src/c/nncgc.c
  Maarten van Iterson, from the Bioconductor package SSPA 2.30.0 (src/nncgc.c), GPL (>= 2).
  It adapts cgmin, the conjugate-gradient minimiser of optim() in R (src/appl/optim.c, R Core
  Team, GPL (>= 2); after J. C. Nash, Compact Numerical Methods for Computers, Algorithm 22).
  The file is unchanged apart from the notice at its top. The shared library built from it is
  covered by the GPL (>= 2). Only the power analysis uses it (nncg() in R/util_sspa.R). SSPA is
  not in the current Bioconductor release, so there is no package to call instead.

R/general_misc_utils.R: rowcoltt() and checkfac()
  The interface follows genefilter (W. Huber, Artistic-2.0). The arithmetic is vectorised base R
  (.rowcolttests); no genefilter code is compiled or called.

